      "source": "Registers a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Servlet.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Servlet</code></a> in a Servlet 3.0+ container. Can be used as an\nannotation-based alternative to <a href=\"ServletRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>ServletRegistrationBean</code></a>.",
